      "width": 406.11905433599935,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "Ctrl + Tap - Ivertir mask\nCtrl + Alt - Unmask en negativo\nCtrl + Drag - Clear Mask\nCtrl + Tap in the masked object - Blur Mask\nCtrl + Alt + Tap in the masked object - Sharpen Mask",
